Server side
-----------
TortoiseBotsForever (TortoiseBots ported to ForeverCore, a community-made
TrinityCore-based server emulator)
https://github.com/TortoiseBots/TortoiseBotsForever

Port
----
Ported to the WoW Forever client in November 2026 by waterys419
(https://github.com/waterys419). The add-on message protocol is unchanged; only
the client API underneath was ported (PORT-NOTES.md). PORT-NOTES.md and
PROTOCOL.md are additions of the port.

Client API reference
--------------------
API usage in the Forever client was learned from Karrz's ForeverBots add-on
(GPL-2.0, Kyzer/repack distribution). No ForeverBots code was copied; the
Compatibility shim (Compat.lua) and the fake server are original to this port.

